00:43:32.810 --> 00:43:34.490
He's a phenomenal writer.

1105
00:43:34.750 --> 00:43:34.990
Yeah.

1106
00:43:35.130 --> 00:43:36.530
And he was a friend of Mike's.

1107
00:43:36.610 --> 00:43:38.950
And Mindy sort of chimed in that Mike loved to do that.

1108
00:43:39.050 --> 00:43:41.310
He loved to put his friends' names in things.

1109
00:43:41.810 --> 00:43:42.970
He was a Conan writer.

1110
