And he stands up for her first by saying, that's my girlfriend.

1130
00:44:14.350 --> 00:44:14.790
Boy.

1131
00:44:15.030 --> 00:44:17.430
And then he backpedals and says, I mean, we hooked up.

1132
00:44:17.650 --> 00:44:20.270
And then Josh Porter's like, you hooked up with Jan?

1133
00:44:21.010 --> 00:44:22.550
And now he's in it.

1134
00:44:22.690 --> 00:44:23.770
He spilled the beans.

1135
00:44:23.910 --> 00:44:24.770
Dang it, Michael.

1136
00:44:24.970 --> 00:44:25.410
Michael.

1137
00:44:25.670 --> 00:44:27.670
He's only been there like five minutes.

1138
00:44:27.930 --> 00:44:28.110
Yeah.

1139
00:44:28.230 --> 00:44:30.390
He's been in a room with these people for five minutes.

1140
00:44:30.390 --> 00:44:33.530
And he's already told everyone that he's hooked up with Jan.

1141
00:44:33.730 --> 00:44:34.490
With their boss.

1142
00:44:34.710 --> 00:44:34.970
Yeah.

1143
00:44:35.110 --> 00:44:35.730
Oh, Michael.

1144
00:44:35.990 --> 00:44:37.730
And then it's like crickets in the room.

1145
00:44:38.110 --> 00:44:38.450
All right.

1146
00:44:38.450 --> 00:44:40.050
