Well, I used to do an opposite thing in college.

1264
00:48:56.220 --> 00:49:01.260
So I was not a big drinker, but I wanted to go to the parties and not be judged.

1265
00:49:01.260 --> 00:49:03.940
So you'd bring a Super Gulp full of, like, soda?

1266
00:49:04.160 --> 00:49:06.920
I would bring a red Solo Cup full.

1267
00:49:06.920 --> 00:49:09.080
Your own Solo Cup to the party?

1268
00:49:09.080 --> 00:49:10.420
Your own red Solo Cup.

1269
00:49:10.600 --> 00:49:14.120
And then I would put something non-alcoholic in it.

1270
00:49:14.180 --> 00:49:15.220
And you'd be like, I'm good.

1271
00:49:15.220 --> 00:49:15.660
I've got my drink.

1272
00:49:15.660 --> 00:49:16.500
Yeah, I got it.

1273
00:49:16.500 --> 00:49:17.120
I'm fine.

1274
00:49:17.120 --> 00:49:17.540
I'm good.

1275
00:49:17.680 --> 00:49:23.000
I don't need to get drunk on whatever you're handing out weird frat boy party.

1276
